        "title": "While Loops Advanced",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Let's dive into controlling the times a while loop repeats its code, like this game HUD that uses a loop to spawn enemies from <code>1</code> to <code>10</code> times.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    min-height: 440px;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    height: 25px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   em,&#xA;   h3,&#xA;   #slider {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   .enemy {&#xA;    display: inline-flex;&#xA;    align-items: center;&#xA;    gap: 8px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&quot;display: inline-block; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;em&gt;Move the input element below&lt;/em&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Enemies to spawn: &lt;span id=&quot;enemiesToSpawn&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div id=&quot;slider&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 25px;&quot;&gt;1 &lt;input min=&quot;1&quot;&#xA;     max=&quot;10&quot; oninput=&quot;spawnEnemies(this.value);&quot; type=&quot;range&quot;&#xA;     value=&quot;3&quot;&gt; 10&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;ol id=&quot;list&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   spawnEnemies(3);&#xA;   &#xA;   function spawnEnemies(enemyCount) {&#xA;    let enemiesToSpawn = document.getElementById(&quot;enemiesToSpawn&quot;);&#xA;    enemiesToSpawn.innerHTML = enemyCount;&#xA;    let list = document.getElementById(&quot;list&quot;);&#xA;    list.innerHTML = &quot;&quot;;&#xA;    let counter = 1;&#xA;    while (counter &lt;= enemyCount) {&#xA;     let item = document.createElement(&quot;li&quot;);&#xA;     item.className = &quot;enemy&quot;;&#xA;     item.innerHTML = &quot;&lt;img src=&quot; + &quot;https://mimo.app/i/bolt.png&quot; + &quot; height=25&gt; Slime Enemy&quot;;&#xA;     list.appendChild(item);&#xA;     counter++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To control the number of times a <code>while</code> loop repeats, we start with a variable set to a number. We call this variable a <strong>counter variable</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Then, we use a comparison in the condition to compare the counter variable to a number. In this case, <code>counter &lt; 4</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>counter</code>, followed by <code>&lt;</code>, and finally <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inside the code block, we make the condition return <code>false</code> and stop the loop by incrementing the counter variable. Try it with <code>counter++</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"90\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>counter++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Changing the condition tells the loop when to stop. For example, changing the condition to <code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Changing the counter variable's value changes when the loop starts. Like setting <code>counter</code> to <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Since the whole code block runs, the order you write code affects what the console displays. Place <code>counter++</code> first to display <code>6</code> through <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"84\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wave &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>counter++;</code>, followed by <code>console.log(\"Wave \" + counter);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the variable used to count the number of times a loop repeats called?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A counter variable</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A tracker variable</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A counter variable.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the condition of this <code>while</code> loop?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does <code>counter++</code> do?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It increases <code>counter</code> by one each time the loop runs its code block</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It creates the <code>counter</code> variable</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It increases <code>counter</code> by one each time the loop runs its code block.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score bonus x&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The numbers <code>1</code> through <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The numbers <code>1</code> through <code>10</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The numbers <code>1</code> through <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146775,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" level++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The numbers <code>2</code> through <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The numbers <code>1</code> through <code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The numbers <code>2</code> through <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" checkpoint = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (checkpoint &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checkpoint &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + checkpoint);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" checkpoint++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The numbers <code>1</code> through <code>9</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The numbers <code>1</code> through <code>11</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The numbers <code>1</code> through <code>9</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146777,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create the counter variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyNumber = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyNumber &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyNumber + \" /><text value=\"&quot;. Slime Enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" enemyNumber++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>let</code> followed by <code>enemyNumber</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display the numbers <code>1</code> through <code>5</code> by setting the condition to <code>number &lt; 6</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (number &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" number++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>number</code>, followed by <code>&lt;</code>, and finally <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 146779,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>So that the loop stops, increment the counter variable inside the code block.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit combo &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>counter</code> followed by <code>+</code> and then <code>+</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 146780,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display <code>1</code> through <code>7</code> in the console by changing the condition.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wave &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>8</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
